    "推荐「双击 Command (⌘ ⌘)」或「双击 Control (⌃ ⌃)」，敲击两下极速呼出/收起，全屏沉浸零打断。AI 对话窗热键在「快捷键设置」中独立配置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recommend \"Double-tap Command (⌘ ⌘)\" or \"Double-tap Control (⌃ ⌃)\" — two quick taps to summon/dismiss at top speed, zero interruption in fullscreen. The AI window hotkey is configured separately in Shortcuts Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐「双击 Command (⌘ ⌘)」或「双击 Control (⌃ ⌃)」，敲击两下极速呼出/收起，全屏沉浸零打断。AI 对话窗热键在「快捷键设置」中独立配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
