    "「琥珀暖色」将主角时钟与高亮点缀切换为暖金琥珀调；明暗模式作用于整个 App（面板/玻璃/设置窗口），「自动」跟随系统外观。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"Amber Warm\" switches the hero clock and highlights to a warm amber tone; Light/Dark Mode applies to the whole app (panel/glass/settings window), with \"Auto\" following the system appearance."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「琥珀暖色」将主角时钟与高亮点缀切换为暖金琥珀调；明暗模式作用于整个 App（面板/玻璃/设置窗口），「自动」跟随系统外观。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
