    "主面板与 AI 对话窗热键各自独立、并行生效；两者命中键冲突时后设置者被拒绝并保持原设置（左⌘ + 右⌘ 可共存，任意⌘ + 左⌘ 冲突）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Main panel and AI window hotkeys are independent and work in parallel; when their keys conflict, the later one is rejected and the original kept (left ⌘ + right ⌘ coexist; any ⌘ + left ⌘ conflicts)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主面板与 AI 对话窗热键各自独立、并行生效；两者命中键冲突时后设置者被拒绝并保持原设置（左⌘ + 右⌘ 可共存，任意⌘ + 左⌘ 冲突）。"
          }
        }
