          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工具"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按类别分组展示；灰色等宽小字是模型调用的工具标识。关闭后 AI 将无法调用对应工具，下一轮对话起生效；危险工具执行前仍会逐个弹窗确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grouped by category; the gray monospace text is the tool identifier the model calls. When disabled, AI can no longer call that tool (effective from the next turn); dangerous tools still require per-execution confirmation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按类别分组展示；灰色等宽小字是模型调用的工具标识。关闭后 AI 将无法调用对应工具，下一轮对话起生效；危险工具执行前仍会逐个弹窗确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
